<title>FRANCE: GdesEaux back to profit in 1996.</title>
<headline>GdesEaux back to profit in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in billions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable		   profit 1.95  vs loss    3.686</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)			 12  vs    up 6.7 pct</p>
<p>    Operating					3.8  vs	     1.7</p>
<p>    Turnover				     165.9  vs	     163</p>
<p>    Debt   (million)			    45.1  vs	    51.7</p>
<p>    Cashflow  (million)			  7.5  vs	     4.9</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
